Moved `metrics.inc('jobs')` out of the retry loop in `src/dispatcher.js` so it fires once per job, before any attempt; `processed`/`failed` still come from `recordJob` at the final outcome. `metrics.js` is untouched, so the counter set and snapshot stay exactly `jobs`, `processed`, `failed`.

Added two dispatcher tests: a flaky job that succeeds on its 3rd attempt counts `{ jobs: 1, processed: 1, failed: 0 }`, and a job exhausting retries counts `{ jobs: 1, processed: 0, failed: 1 }`. `node --test` passes 67/67.
